{"version":3,"createdAt":1791625235684,"mainModel":{"schemaVersion":8,"id":"cm_mv270u8w","key":"cm_mv270u8w","name":"Planchard Chapter6 - review Q1-Q16 - browser 2026-10-10","kind":"part","authoringMode":"fully-parametric","localFrame":{"origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"yAxis":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"zAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},"references":[{"id":"origin","type":"origin","name":"Origin","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:top","type":"plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"parameters":{},"sketches":[{"id":"sk_19wfi","name":"X·Z sketch","plane":"top","offset":0,"referenceId":"plane:top","points":[],"entities":[],"constraints":[],"diagnostics":[],"status":"fully-defined"}],"features":[],"history":[{"id":"history:sketch:sk_19wfi","kind":"sketch","targetId":"sk_19wfi","name":"X·Z sketch","suppressed":false,"status":"rebuilt"}],"parts":[],"assemblies":[],"appearances":[],"notes":[],"markups":[],"rules":{},"metadata":{"authoringSystem":"parametric-v1"},"topologyBindings":[],"namedSelections":[],"revision":1,"lastRebuild":{"ok":true,"signature":"{\"definitionId\":\"cm_mv270u8w\",\"features\":[],\"history\":[{\"id\":\"history:sketch:sk_19wfi\",\"kind\":\"sketch\",\"suppressed\":false,\"targetId\":\"sk_19wfi\"}],\"overrides\":{},\"revision\":1,\"sketches\":[{\"constraints\":[],\"entities\":[],\"id\":\"sk_19wfi\",\"name\":\"X·Z sketch\",\"offset\":0,\"plane\":\"top\",\"points\":[],\"referenceId\":\"plane:top\"}]}","issues":[],"rebuiltAt":1791625219942},"price":500,"col":"#c9bfae","constraints":[],"rollback":null,"activeSketch":"sk_19wfi","variables":[],"referenceGeometry":[{"id":"plane:top","type":"reference_plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"reference_plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"reference_plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"reference_axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"reference_axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"reference_axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"definitionId":"cm_mv270u8w","documentVersion":1,"context":{"kind":"part","units":{"length":"mm","angle":"deg","mass":"kg","precision":3},"activeCoordinateSystemId":"origin"},"customProperties":{"Description":"Chapter6 reviewQ1-Q16, printed6-33/PDF301 Planchard2021. Browser-authored answer worksheet: independent explanations of source concepts, no official answer-key/native CAD/external certification claim. SOLIDWORKS menus described as book workflow, ModelForge equivalents identified where needed."},"drawing":{"version":1,"draftingStandard":"custom","secondaryUnits":"","secondaryPrecision":2,"size":"A3","orientation":"landscape","projection":"third","units":"mm","scale":"fit","showHidden":true,"showCenters":true,"showZones":true,"views":[],"dims":[],"notes":[{"id":"nvkhw95h","x":74.60956761890256,"y":24.64126801587906,"text":"CHAPTER6 - REVIEW ANSWERS Q1-Q16\nSource: printed6-33 / PDF301, Planchard2021.\nIndependent explanations; book menus identified as source workflow.\nNo official answer-key, authored CAD or certification claim.","leader":null},{"id":"nc9b8oko","x":74.60956761890256,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q1 - Revolve/thin/dome features\nRevolved Base creates the initial solid by rotating a profile\nabout an axis;Revolved Boss adds similarly rotated\nmaterial;Revolved Cut removes rotated profile volume;Revolved Cut\nThin removes a specified-thickness swept/revolved band;Dome forms\na domed deformation on selected face geometry.","leader":null},{"id":"ndgcj2bt","x":74.60956761890256,"y":88.72758326182641,"text":"Q2 - Symmetry\nConstrain paired sketch entities as mirror images about a\ncenterline,keeping corresponding distances/shapes equal.","leader":null},{"id":"n9t2l112","x":74.60956761890256,"y":107.25253899101664,"text":"Q3 - Trim Entities\nRemove unwanted portions of sketch geometry to produce the\nintended profile while retaining the required boundaries.","leader":null},{"id":"nf3l616q","x":74.60956761890256,"y":125.77747638496587,"text":"Q4 - Shell\nHollow a solid to a specified wall thickness,optionally removing\nselected faces to create openings.","leader":null},{"id":"na47ibj7","x":74.60956761890256,"y":144.3024321141561,"text":"Q5 - Centerpoint arc\nThree points:center,start,end.","leader":null},{"id":"nrvw7j8b","x":74.60956761890256,"y":159.32266153370463,"text":"Q6 - Hole Wizard\nCreates standardized hole types/sizes/end conditions and\npositional geometry,e.g.clearance,tapped,counterbored,countersunk\nholes. Standard metadata does not make a cosmetic thread a\nphysical helix.","leader":null},{"id":"nmmaeqoe","x":74.60956761890256,"y":184.85705154693719,"text":"Q7 - Spline\nA smooth curve controlled by fit/control points and optional\ntangent/curvature handles,used for shapes not conveniently formed\nfrom straight lines/circular arcs.","leader":null},{"id":"nb2qs8b4","x":74.60956761890256,"y":206.88671525052808,"text":"Q8 - Circular Pattern inputs\nSeed feature/body/face scope,rotation axis,instance count and\nangular extent/spacing;choose required instances and\nmerge/geometry options where applicable.","leader":null},{"id":"npatlyo7","x":264.8658008214373,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q9 - Temporary axes menu\nBook:View→Hide/Show→Temporary Axes.","leader":null},{"id":"n9ghj4d7","x":264.8658008214373,"y":74.70869635850076,"text":"Q10 - Show/hide plane\nBook:select/right-click the plane in the FeatureManager and\nchoose Show or Hide;global plane display can also be controlled\nthrough View→Hide/Show.","leader":null},{"id":"noi3jfc1","x":264.8658008214373,"y":96.73837839733264,"text":"Q11 - Offset versus Convert\nConvert projects selected existing edges/faces into the active\nsketch and can keep their association;Offset creates\nparallel/concentric copies at a specified distance,with\ndirection/scope options.","leader":null},{"id":"nsx5mrc5","x":264.8658008214373,"y":122.27276841056519,"text":"Q12 - Mirror reference line\nA construction centerline.","leader":null},{"id":"nsrnne9z","x":264.8658008214373,"y":137.29299783011373,"text":"Q13 - Mirror relation\nSymmetric relation about that centerline.","leader":null},{"id":"ncavpror","x":264.8658008214373,"y":152.3132272496623,"text":"Q14 - Center for maximum arc dimension\nFalse. Selecting the center gives a center-based dimension.\nChoose the arc's appropriate side/selection condition or set its\nArc Condition to Max to dimension the far extreme.","leader":null},{"id":"n3873ehz","x":264.8658008214373,"y":174.3428909532532,"text":"Q15 - Transparency on Features toolbar\nFalse. The book treats transparency as an optical/appearance\nproperty and also uses Change Transparency from the context\ninterface.","leader":null},{"id":"nq6m0jge","x":264.8658008214373,"y":196.37255465684407,"text":"Q16 - Further Revolve information\nSOLIDWORKS Help and the feature PropertyManager help;the book\nalso directs users to SOLIDWORKS Tutorials for worked examples.","leader":null}],"primitives":[],"title":{"revision":"A","sheet":1,"sheets":1,"title":"CHAPTER6 - REVIEW Q1-Q16","number":"PLANCHARD6-33/PDF301","author":"","company":"","material":"","finish":"","mass":"","date":"2026-10-10","tolerance":""},"seeded":true},"lastStandardsAudit":{"at":1791624684564,"ok":true,"checked":0,"blocking":[]},"exactTopologyCache":{}},"assemblies":[],"drawings":[],"metadata":{"generator":"ModelForge CAD SolidWorks-Class","units":"mm","attachmentStorage":"content-addressed","activeDocument":{"type":"part","key":"cm_mv270u8w"}},"attachments":[]}